item><item><title>养生界NMN</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E5%85%BB%E7%94%9F%E7%95%8Cnmn/</link><pubDate>Sat, 08 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sat, 08 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E5%85%BB%E7%94%9F%E7%95%8Cnmn/</guid><description/><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%85%bb%e7%94%9f%e7%95%8cNMN.assets/53ead25bec8e940adb9857903eaea4a.jpg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>产品信息</category><category>养生产品tcmproduct</category></item><item><title>[置顶] 中药疫苗 - 新冠预防方</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/posts/tcm-vaccine/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 21 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/posts/tcm-vaccine/</guid><description>English Version 我们破除种种障难，克服种种困难，冒着种种风险，公布这个预防药方，希望它能救更多的人，希望更多的人能因此得救： 中国商务部有个统计，截至3月</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><category>新冠预防方</category><category>新冠知识及就诊 Covid Insights &amp; Consultation</category><category>新冠预防方 Preventive Herbs</category></item><item><title>静待有缘人：扩招三天</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E9%9D%99%E5%BE%85%E6%9C%89%E7%BC%98%E4%BA%BA-%E6%89%A9%E6%8B%9B%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A9/</link><pubDate>Fri, 07 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 07 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E9%9D%99%E5%BE%85%E6%9C%89%E7%BC%98%E4%BA%BA-%E6%89%A9%E6%8B%9B%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A9/</guid><description>第一次招生早已结束，现在回想起来仍难以平静。在招生互动中，的的确确看到了很多人提到的当今“看病难、看病贵”的问题。 这期间收到诸多“合伙人”来</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e9%9d%99%e5%be%85%e6%9c%89%e7%bc%98%e4%ba%ba%20%e6%89%a9%e6%8b%9b%e4%b8%89%e5%a4%a9.assets/640-1717963748898-103.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>招生</category><category>中医学习班 TCM Study Group</category></item><item><title>对路（二）</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E5%AF%B9%E8%B7%AF%E4%BA%8C/</link><pubDate>Wed, 05 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 05 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E5%AF%B9%E8%B7%AF%E4%BA%8C/</guid><description>因为我们都比较执着这个身体，杨医生教授用无我去对治我的时候，以前是从书本上学习到，好像也知道这么个道理。但是杨医生教授后，好像体会要深入了。</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%af%b9%e8%b7%af%e4%ba%8c.assets/640.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>中医学习班 TCM Study Group</category></item><item><title>对路（一）</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E5%AF%B9%E8%B7%AF%E4%B8%80/</link><pubDate>Tue, 04 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Tue, 04 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E5%AF%B9%E8%B7%AF%E4%B8%80/</guid><description>杨医生好！ 学习以来，有太多太多的收获和很大的改变，感恩杨医生！感恩！感恩！ 杨医生不仅通达，还能够把所有知识融会贯通，系统化，究竟，这才是真正</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%af%b9%e8%b7%af%e4%b8%80.assets/640-1717962880160-62.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>中医学习班 TCM Study Group</category></item><item><title>你太瘦了，营养不良，要多吃点...</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E4%BD%A0%E5%A4%AA%E7%98%A6%E4%BA%86-%E8%90%A5%E5%85%BB%E4%B8%8D%E8%89%AF-%E8%A6%81%E5%A4%9A%E5%90%83%E7%82%B9/</link><pubDate>Fri, 31 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 31 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E4%BD%A0%E5%A4%AA%E7%98%A6%E4%BA%86-%E8%90%A5%E5%85%BB%E4%B8%8D%E8%89%AF-%E8%A6%81%E5%A4%9A%E5%90%83%E7%82%B9/</guid><description>杨医生您好： 7天复谷今日结束，与您分享我的感受，首先非常感恩您。因为，这么多天辟谷对于我来说，应该是没有一个人大胆到让我做这件事情的。 我经常</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e4%b8%80%e5%b0%81%e8%af%b7%e5%ad%a6%e4%bf%a1.assets/image-20240602194137981.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>辟谷</category><category>中医学习班 TCM Study Group</category></item><item><title>一封《请学信》</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E4%B8%80%E5%B0%81%E8%AF%B7%E5%AD%A6%E4%BF%A1/</link><pubDate>Wed, 29 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 29 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E4%B8%80%E5%B0%81%E8%AF%B7%E5%AD%A6%E4%BF%A1/</guid><description>尊敬的医生老师，您好，我在这里向您问候早安，祝福您吉祥安康。本次，我鼓起勇气，再次向老师发出这封《请学信》，请您审阅。 以慈悲心出世，了脱生死</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e4%b8%80%e5%b0%81%e8%af%b7%e5%ad%a6%e4%bf%a1.assets/image-20240602194137981.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>中医学习班 TCM Study Group</category></item><item><title>老药的故事之一款好用平价良药，全程亲自采购加工</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%BE%E5%A5%BD%E7%94%A8%E5%B9%B3%E4%BB%B7%E8%89%AF%E8%8D%AF-%E5%85%A8%E7%A8%8B%E4%BA%B2%E8%87%AA%E9%87%87%E8%B4%AD%E5%8A%A0%E5%B7%A5/</link><pubDate>Mon, 27 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Mon, 27 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%BE%E5%A5%BD%E7%94%A8%E5%B9%B3%E4%BB%B7%E8%89%AF%E8%8D%AF-%E5%85%A8%E7%A8%8B%E4%BA%B2%E8%87%AA%E9%87%87%E8%B4%AD%E5%8A%A0%E5%B7%A5/</guid><description>现在来说，每个行业深耕一下都会发现不少问题。 今天跟大家普及一个重要的养生、治病知识。通常来说身体有问题，肝脏一定是率先出问题。肝脏在中医里被</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%80%81%e8%8d%af%e7%9a%84%e6%95%85%e4%ba%8b%e4%b9%8b%e4%b8%80%e6%ac%be%e5%a5%bd%e7%94%a8%e5%b9%b3%e4%bb%b7%e8%89%af%e8%8d%af%20%e5%85%a8%e7%a8%8b%e4%ba%b2%e8%87%aa%e9%87%87%e8%b4%ad%e5%8a%a0%e5%b7%a5.assets/640-1717371098380-10.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>老药</category><category>珍珠粉</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>昨晚的学习，您给了我很大的震撼</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E6%98%A8%E6%99%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0-%E6%82%A8%E7%BB%99%E4%BA%86%E6%88%91%E5%BE%88%E5%A4%A7%E7%9A%84%E9%9C%87%E6%92%BC/</link><pubDate>Thu, 23 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 23 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E6%98%A8%E6%99%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0-%E6%82%A8%E7%BB%99%E4%BA%86%E6%88%91%E5%BE%88%E5%A4%A7%E7%9A%84%E9%9C%87%E6%92%BC/</guid><description>壹 等待是值得的 昨晚的学习，您给了我很大的震撼。空性智慧是我一直在追求的，但是我做得并不好。 学法这么多年虽然也一直发愿，但是在境来的时候，第一</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%98%a8%e6%99%9a%e7%9a%84%e5%ad%a6%e4%b9%a0%20%e6%82%a8%e7%bb%99%e4%ba%86%e6%88%91%e5%be%88%e5%a4%a7%e7%9a%84%e9%9c%87%e6%92%bc.assets/640.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>中医学习班 TCM Study Group</category></item><item><title>自己已经十年没碰那东西了..</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%8D%81%E5%B9%B4%E6%B2%A1%E7%A2%B0%E9%82%A3%E4%B8%9C%E8%A5%BF%E4%BA%86/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 17 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%8D%81%E5%B9%B4%E6%B2%A1%E7%A2%B0%E9%82%A3%E4%B8%9C%E8%A5%BF%E4%BA%86/</guid><description>师父，跟您汇报一下吃肉的事。上周一您说要吃块肉，当时一听就懵了，心里反抗啊，不吃不吃！就不吃！想想自己已经10年没碰那东西了。 记得最后一次吃</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%87%aa%e5%b7%b1%e5%b7%b2%e7%bb%8f%e5%8d%81%e5%b9%b4%e6%b2%a1%e7%a2%b0%e9%82%a3%e4%b8%9c%e8%a5%bf%e4%ba%86.assets/640.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>中医学习班 TCM Study Group</category></item><item><title>心得</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E5%BF%83%E5%BE%97/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 21 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E5%BF%83%E5%BE%97/</guid><description>师父，请允许我这么冒昧的称呼您，我知道我并不够资格。 自从学习群开始说要早晚站桩打坐共修，而且有十个人是要求早晚共修都要参加的。我就自动把自己</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%bf%83%e5%be%97.assets/image-20240421162530753.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>中医学习班 TCM Study Group</category></item><item><title>最大的感悟</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E7%9A%84%E6%84%9F%E6%82%9F/</link><pubDate>Sun, 07 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 07 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E7%9A%84%E6%84%9F%E6%82%9F/</guid><description>中医课 • 最大的感悟 1 一阴一阳之谓道 杨师说：今天的课程有点抽象。末学感觉很实在，很具体。天地之间，天为阳地为阴，一阴一阳为之道。天地之道是什么</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%9c%80%e5%a4%a7%e7%9a%84%e6%84%9f%e6%82%9f.assets/640-1712526404053-36.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>中医学习班 TCM Study Group</category></item><item><title>醍醐灌顶</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E9%86%8D%E9%86%90%E7%81%8C%E9%A1%B6/</link><pubDate>Fri, 05 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 05 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E9%86%8D%E9%86%90%E7%81%8C%E9%A1%B6/</guid><description>阴阳 天地人 今早课，杨医生讲空和不空。 我理解阴阳就是一种能量，这种能量是否存在于整个宇宙当中，整个十法界中，所有天地间的一切万事万物当中。 无论</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e9%86%8d%e9%86%90%e7%81%8c%e9%a1%b6.assets/640-1712525180299-21.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>中医学习班 TCM Study Group</category></item><item><title>一篇文章引发的讨论与思考</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E4%B8%80%E7%AF%87%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0%E5%BC%95%E5%8F%91%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E4%B8%8E%E6%80%9D%E8%80%83/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Mon, 01 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E4%B8%80%E7%AF%87%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0%E5%BC%95%E5%8F%91%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E4%B8%8E%E6%80%9D%E8%80%83/</guid><description>与你一起阅读如是当下 Chapter 01.我会有分别心吗？ 如果我是杨医生，我会有分别心吗？我也问过自己无数遍。如果我是一个伟大的医者，我会做到不论是达官贵</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e4%b8%80%e7%af%87%e6%96%87%e7%ab%a0%e5%bc%95%e5%8f%91%e7%9a%84%e8%ae%a8%e8%ae%ba%e4%b8%8e%e6%80%9d%e8%80%83.assets/image-20240407105743538.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>中医学习班 TCM Study Group</category></item><item><title>错失 —— 每个人的习气是如此深重</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E9%94%99%E5%A4%B1-%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%B9%A0%E6%B0%94%E6%98%AF%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E6%B7%B1%E9%87%8D/</link><pubDate>Thu, 28 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 28 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcmcourse/%E9%94%99%E5%A4%B1-%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%B9%A0%E6%B0%94%E6%98%AF%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E6%B7%B1%E9%87%8D/</guid><description>感恩遇见 感恩遇见，一切都是最好的安排。 杨医生您好， 思前想后觉得还是写下一点东西，作为这段时间的记录和总结。 我很长一段时间有一个毛病总改不了，</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%